    "section_faq_hyUJah": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "text_rVPeDH": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is Green Envee?",
            "content": "<p>Green Envee is a clinical wellness skincare company offering professional treatment and retail systems that blend high-performance plant actives with advanced delivery technology to deliver visible results while elevating the client experience through ritual-driven skincare.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_rimHr7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will I have support?",
            "content": "<p>Your partnership includes access to Green Envee University, full product protocols, marketing + sales tools, and direct 1:1 support so you are never left to figure it out alone.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_awDwxx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I try before I commit?",
            "content": "<p>Yes - sample access is available before your opening order, including sample sizes and our Skincare Luxe Minis. You can explore those here: <a href=\"https://samples.greenenvee.com/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Green Envee Samples</span></a></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_9iXHg6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What does a typical opening order look like?",
            "content": "<p>You can shop à la carte or choose from our curated packages based on your business and clientele.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_yBtmLf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What does the investment look like and how quickly can I see a return?",
            "content": "<p>Most pros performing 10-15 facials a week and retailing recommended home-care see their opening order returned within the first one to two weeks. We'll map out exactly what that looks like for your specific business on our call.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
